      "body": "Agree this is a bug.\n\nRegarding the proposed solution, I actually rather think we should go with `from None` (i.e. no cause/context). Since I don't think it would be right to say that the assertion failure is *caused* by the exception, the exception is expected and of the correct type, but its message is unexpected and we should just focus on that.  Let me know if you disagree.",
